            ♥ Django Girls Europe is organized by <a href="http://twitter.com/olasitarska">Ola Sitarska</a> and <a href="http://twitter.com/asednecka">Ola Sendecka</a> with the support from <a href="http://europython.eu/">EuroPython 2014</a>.<br> Django Girls Europe is a part of <a href="/">Django Girls</a>.
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
